<title>USA: TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KEY BISCYANE, Florida 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $4.45 million Lipton Championships tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, third round</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Tommy Haas (Germany) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>5-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>5-7 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Women's singles, fourth round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 16-Elena Likhovtseva</p>
<p>(Russia) 6-3 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>Sadrine Testud (France) beat 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-0 7-5</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>4-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>7-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 1-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>8-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-2 4-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>11-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-1</p>
<p>2-6 6-1</p>
</text>
